    {
      "name": "dsh-plugin-opencode-router",
      "title": {
        "en": "OpenCode model router",
        "zh": "OpenCode 本地模型路由"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Runs a loopback OpenAI-compatible endpoint in front of the OpenCode Go/Zen gateways: adds the x-opencode-session header they require, routes each model to the gateway that serves it, serves a live model list, and adds a sidebar panel for the URL, API key, models and recent requests.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 里跑一个本机 OpenAI 兼容端点，转发到 OpenCode 的 Go / Zen 网关：自动补上网关强制要求的 x-opencode-session 头，按模型归属选择网关，提供实时模型列表，并在侧边栏加一个面板用于配置地址、key、浏览模型与查看最近请求。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/dsh-plugin-opencode-router.svg",
      "author": "SingleDemo",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/SingleDemo/dsh-plugin-opencode-router#readme",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/SingleDemo/dsh-plugin-opencode-router"
      },
